> **What if valuable learning didn't have to disappear?**

What if, instead of constantly starting over, humans and AI systems could continuously build on verified learning?

What if the world's personal AI systems could become smarter together without requiring everyone to surrender their privacy?

What if intelligence could compound?

That's the problem NayaNet is trying to solve.

